    "title": "Pocket Novels",
    "description": "Pocket Novel Reader is one of the fast upcoming Novel App, aiming to enrich the lives of millions of readers every day. It brings you the world's best novels from the best authors.And it also gives you the ease to read your favourite novel out at the gym, cooking, about to go to bed, or just about anywhere else based on your comfort. It has all the best sellers of various categories like:\r\n- Romance\r\n- Suspense and Thriller\r\n- Drama\r\n- Fantasy\r\n- Horror\r\n- Classic and more coming !!!\r\nWhat you'll love about Pocket Novel:\r\n1)Quick Daily Updates\r\nJoin as readers & look forward to the daily-updated chapters. Pocket Novel brings you an unequal and immersive novel-reading atmosphere.\r\n2) Active community That Loves To Read\r\nPocket Novel attracts the best readers and authors who dedicate all passions of reading and writing. No matter you like reading translated Novel or the original one, a romance novel, or Fantasy novel, with sharing common interests of reading, readers and authors come together, regardless of genre. Download Pocket Novel now. Start your reading or writing journey and be part of a fun-loving and active community.\r\n3) Share Your Story and Gather Your Fans\r\nJoin with thousands of aspiring authors. Start you journey, telling your stories on the Pocket Novel. \"The journey of a thousand miles begins with a single step.\" Join our contest and publish your novel with our matchmaking system to interested readers who share a similar interest in your genre. Find your words and share you message with the world.\r\nPrivacy Policy - https://www.pocketfm.in/privacy-policy\r\nTerms and conditions - https://www.pocketfm.in/terms-and-conditions\r\nFollow us on Twitter: https://mobile.twitter.com/pocketnovel_ind\r\nFollow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/pocketnovelindia/\r\nFollow us on sharechat: https://sharechat.com/profile/pocket_novel?d=n\r\nFollow us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/Pocket-Novels-110194281432289/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Pocket Novel Reader is one of the fast upcoming Novel App, aiming to enrich the lives of millions of readers every day. It brings you the world&#39;s best novels from the best authors.And it also gives you the ease to read your favourite novel out at the gym, cooking, about to go to bed, or just about anywhere else based on your comfort. It has all the best sellers of various categories like:<br>- Romance<br>- Suspense and Thriller<br>- Drama<br>- Fantasy<br>- Horror<br>- Classic and more coming !!!<br>What you&#39;ll love about Pocket Novel:<br>1)Quick Daily Updates<br>Join as readers &amp; look forward to the daily-updated chapters. Pocket Novel brings you an unequal and immersive novel-reading atmosphere.<br>2) Active community That Loves To Read<br>Pocket Novel attracts the best readers and authors who dedicate all passions of reading and writing. No matter you like reading translated Novel or the original one, a romance novel, or Fantasy novel, with sharing common interests of reading, readers and authors come together, regardless of genre. Download Pocket Novel now. Start your reading or writing journey and be part of a fun-loving and active community.<br>3) Share Your Story and Gather Your Fans<br>Join with thousands of aspiring authors. Start you journey, telling your stories on the Pocket Novel. &quot;The journey of a thousand miles begins with a single step.&quot; Join our contest and publish your novel with our matchmaking system to interested readers who share a similar interest in your genre. Find your words and share you message with the world.<br>Privacy Policy - https://www.pocketfm.in/privacy-policy<br>Terms and conditions - https://www.pocketfm.in/terms-and-conditions<br>Follow us on Twitter: https://mobile.twitter.com/pocketnovel_ind<br>Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/pocketnovelindia/<br>Follow us on sharechat: https://sharechat.com/profile/pocket_novel?d=n<br>Follow us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.c